{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom Shopify section called “Four Image Gallery.”
    
    This section should display 4 images in a single row (side by side), optimized for both desktop and mobile.
    
    Each image must be individually editable in the theme editor, with the following customizable settings for each image:
    
    Upload image
    
    Image width and height (adjustable, maintaining aspect ratio)
    
    Left and right margin
    
    Padding
    
    Distance between images (gap control)
    
    Option for corner radius (to round corners if desired)
    
    Option for image link (so each image can be clickable)
    
    The section itself should include:
    
    Global control for overall padding (top and bottom)
    
    Global control for horizontal margins (left and right sides of the whole section)
    
    Responsive layout that stacks vertically on mobile
    
    The layout must never crop or hide any part of the image — images should resize or scale down as needed to remain fully visible within their frame
    
    Add a smooth zoom-in animation on hover for each image:
    
    When hovered, the image gently scales up (e.g., scale(1.05)) with a 0.4s ease-in-out transition
    
    The zoom must not cause the image to go outside or under its frame — use overflow: hidden to keep it contained
    
    The design should be clean, minimal, and user-friendly in the theme editor.
    
    Additional requirements:
    
    Include alt text for accessibility
    
    Use lazy loading for performance
    
    Make sure spacing and scaling work across desktop, tablet, and mobile
    
    Add an optional section heading and subheading above the row of images
    
    Add an optional background color selector for the section
    
    Section name: Four Image Gallery, When the image zooms in on hover, it must remain fully visible within its frame — no cropping or hidden edges. The hover effect should either:
    
    Scale inward (simulate zoom without enlarging beyond the container), or
    
    Adjust the container size dynamically so the full image is always visible.
    
    In CSS terms:
    
    Replace transform: scale(1.05); with a non-cropping effect, such as transform: scale(1.05) translateZ(0); object-fit: contain;
    
    Or use a zoom-out illusion (e.g., slight scale decrease + brightness increase) instead of a true zoom-in, to preserve full image visibility.
    
    Ensure the container uses overflow: visible; and object-fit: contain; to prevent any clipping., Create a custom Shopify section called “Four Image Gallery.”
    
    This section should display 4 images side by side (in one row) and be fully responsive (4 per row on desktop, 2×2 on tablet, 1×4 stacked on mobile).
    
    🖼️ Individual image settings
    
    Each image must be individually editable in the theme editor with the following options:
    
    Upload image
    
    Adjustable image width and height (default 200 px × 200 px, maintaining aspect ratio)
    
    Adjustable left and right margins (allowing negative values for fine positioning)
    
    Adjustable top and bottom margins (also allowing negative values to move images up or down)
    
    Adjustable padding
    
    Adjustable distance (gap) between this image and the next one
    
    Option for corner radius (for rounded edges if desired)
    
    Option to add a clickable link for each image
    
    🧩 Section-wide controls
    
    Global top and bottom padding controls
    
    Global left and right margin controls for the whole section
    
    Global gap control between images (default = 10 px, but fully adjustable)
    
    Optional background color selector
    
    Optional section heading and subheading above the images
    
    🪄 Hover animation (non-cropping zoom effect)
    
    When hovered, the image should appear to zoom in smoothly but always remain fully visible within its frame (no edges hidden or cropped).
    
    Use a subtle transform: scale(1.05) effect combined with object-fit: contain; overflow: visible; to keep the entire image in view.
    
    Transition: 0.4s ease-in-out
    
    The hover effect should give a soft focus/zoom illusion, not a literal enlargement that cuts off edges.
    
    ⚙️ Technical and design requirements
    
    Default image size: 200 px width × 200 px height, adjustable per image
    
    No image should ever be cropped or hidden, regardless of zoom or resizing
    
    Use lazy loading for performance
    
    Include alt text for accessibility
    
    Clean, minimal visual style (aligned with modern Shopify themes like Dawn or Sense)
    
    All layout and spacing adjustments should be visible directly in the theme editor UI (no code editing needed)
    
    Full
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-four-image-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_margin_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px {{ block.settings.section_margin_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.global_gap }}px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: filter 0.4s ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05) translateZ(0);
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    filter: brightness(1.05);
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  {% for i in (1..4) %}
    {% liquid
      assign width_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_width'
      assign height_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_height'
      assign margin_left_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_margin_left'
      assign margin_right_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_margin_right'
      assign margin_top_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_margin_top'
      assign margin_bottom_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_margin_bottom'
      assign padding_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_padding'
      assign gap_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_gap'
      assign corner_radius_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_corner_radius'

      assign image_width = block.settings[width_key]
      assign image_height = block.settings[height_key]
      assign margin_left = block.settings[margin_left_key]
      assign margin_right = block.settings[margin_right_key]
      assign margin_top = block.settings[margin_top_key]
      assign margin_bottom = block.settings[margin_bottom_key]
      assign padding = block.settings[padding_key]
      assign gap = block.settings[gap_key]
      assign corner_radius = block.settings[corner_radius_key]
    %}

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} {
      margin-left: {{ margin_left }}px;
      margin-right: {{ margin_right }}px;
      margin-top: {{ margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ margin_bottom }}px;
      padding: {{ padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: {{ image_width }}px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border-radius: {{ corner_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} .ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: {{ image_width }} / {{ image_height }};
      border-radius: {{ corner_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} .ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: {{ image_width }} / {{ image_height }};
      border-radius: {{ corner_radius }}px;
    }

    {% if gap > 0 %}
      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} {
        margin-right: calc({{ margin_right }}px + {{ gap }}px);
      }
    {% endif %}

    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      .ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }} {
        margin-left: 0;
        margin-right: 0;
      }
    }
  {% endfor %}
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-four-image-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.subheading != blank %}
    <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-four-image-gallery__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <p class="ai-four-image-gallery__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..4) %}
      {% liquid
        assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
        assign link_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_link'
        assign alt_key = 'image_' | append: i | append: '_alt'
        
        assign image = block.settings[image_key]
        assign link = block.settings[link_key]
        assign alt_text = block.settings[alt_key]
      %}

      <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-four-image-gallery__item-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}">
        {% if link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ link }}" class="ai-four-image-gallery__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if image != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                  alt="{{ alt_text | default: image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ image.width }}"
                  height="{{ image.height }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if image != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                alt="{{ alt_text | default: image.alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-four-image-gallery__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ image.width }}"
                height="{{ image.height }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-four-image-gallery__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

